					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 2: MERGING SHAPES\n\nIn this example we are using the Move and Grid Pattern nodes to create a grid of small circles.\nNext, we merge the 25 instances into a single shape.\nThat shape is then connected to an Union node with a bigger circle.\n\nIf we did not Merge before the Union we would have ended up with 25 shapes."
					}
				},
